[Options]

[A.]
<h2>~[IsunFence.1]Barriers of Hope~[IsunFence.1]</h2>
<i>Guldan: ~wSee those glowing walls?  That is the only thing the stands between us and the enemies guns.  What do you think would happen if the barriers are destroyed?<br>
<i>You: ~wWe die.<br>
<i>Guldan: ~wCorrect.<br>
All four of you quickly built barriers around your islands.  They are not really complete or very strong.

$Button=Knock 'um down,Tell,Mom

[Mom]
~rINCOMING ~wLINK:<br>
<i>^WaR^ Leader: ~wI need your wind Technology...
<i>You: ~wFor what?
<i>^WaR^ Leader: ~wI'm picking up a bunch of men carring wind tech.
<i>You: ~wOk, I guess.
<i>Thanx, here's rain technology... Hey, knight, come here...

[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<p>After the priest whas sacrificed, you felt something like electricity flow through you.  The little zap left your body and went South, to the GOF's fortress.
<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
$Button=Travel there,MissionBegin,FW3

[ai3PriestDead]
<i>^WaR^ Ghost: ~Why did you let me die?<br>
Good Question?  Do you have an answer?<br>
I'll give you 10 seconds to come up with one.
$Timeout=10,Tell,No
$Button=No,Tell,No

[No]
<i>^WaR^ Ghost: ~wWhy don't you have an answer???  Here's a question, when do you except to die?
$Menu=In about 10 years,Tell,Nope
$Menu=In about 20 years,Tell,Nope
$Menu=In about 30 years,Tell,Nope
$Menu=In about 40 years,Tell,Nope
$Menu=In about 50 years,Tell,Nope

[Nope]
<i>^WaR^ Ghost: ~wNope, try today.
$Button=You got 10 seconds to run,MissionAbort,0
$Timeout=10,Tell,Killed

[Killed]
The Ghost summons a mass storm that pulls your island into the abyss of the Furies.
$Button=Bye Bye,MissionAbort,0

[Failed]
<h2>Failure!</h2>
<p>Guldan: You let the barriers down!!!<br>
<p>FW Rogue: It wasn't my fault.<br>
<p>Guldan: Are you saying it was the commander's fault?<br>
<p>FW Rouge: Yes.<br>
$Button=*You have lost your position*,MissionAbort,0

[END]